ABSOLUTE
INSTRUMENTS  : - Portable Declinometer-Inclinometer
               ZEISS 010 + BARTINGTON mag-01H.
               - Portable Proton magnetometer GEOMETRICS
               G856ax.

RECORDING 
VARIOMETER   : - Three-components homocentric fluxgate
               variometer IPGP VM391.
               - Overhauser effect proton
               magnetometer GEOMAG SM90R.

ORIENTATION  : HDZ
DYNAMIC RANGE: +/- 6500 nT
RESOLUTION   : 0.1 nT
SAMPLING RATE: 0.2 sec. 

FILTER TYPE  : 5 Hz reduced by a 15 point Gaussian filter 
               to 1-second data;
               INTERMAGNET 91 point Gaussian filter for 
               the production of 1-minute data from 
               1-second data.
