BASELINE     : 

Double absolute measurements are performed once a week.
Number of absolute measurements used: 83
The baseline is obtained by:
- manual review, removal of abnormal observations
- spline interpolation (Matlab)
- automatic removal of observations which differ
  by twice or more from the standard deviation
- run again spline interpolation to get final result
